OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds attend Glasgow Green
OL,4,Aanti-immigration and counter protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have gathered in
OL,7,FGlasgow for an anti-immigration rally
OL,8,Fand associated counter protest.
OL,10,FThe Pink Ladies organised their event
OL,11,Fat Glasgow Green, prompting opposing
OL,12,Fgroups, including Stand Up To Racism
OL,13,F(SUTR), to arrange a counter protest.
OL,15,FThe two groups were contained in
OL,16,Fseparate areas on the eastern side of
OL,17,Fthe park, both demonstrations separated
OL,18,Fby the People's Palace and a heavy
OL,19,Fpolice presence.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
