OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds attend Glasgow Green
OL,4,Aanti-immigration and counter protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Sup Stevie Dolan warned of a "strong
OL,7,Fresponse" if there was any violence
OL,8,Fafter flashpoints at a previous protest
OL,9,Fin the same park in July.
